   everyone: to share the work, encourage collaboration, and let others
   learn from it, use it and add their own knowledge.

   The reference material is based on publicly available program data.
   The V452 program was disassembled and analysed to place and verify the
   definitions for this calibration.

   This is a community effort, and every contribution matters.
   Corrections, additional findings, technical knowledge and general
   feedback are all very welcome. The more knowledge is shared and the
   more people work together, the more can be achieved.

