/begin CHARACTERISTIC KL_KA_F_VL
  "Gewichtungsfaktor | EN: Weighting factor | [Code V452 IGN 0x40158/0x40368] Full-load weighting of the learned knock adaptation: ka_dtz = learned x (KL_KA_F_VL + KF_KA_F_K) + KF_KA_OFFS_VL, clamped to K_KA_DTZ_MAX..0 (can only retard). Setting it to 0 makes the engine ignore its learned knock retard at full load."
