  "Grundkennfeld Zuendwinkel fuer TL | EN: Base ignition-angle map for part load | [Code V452 IGN 0x66284] Part-load base ignition (n x rf). Part load: per bank with rf_b1/rf_b2. Full load: read with rf_m as the base of the TL->VL blend. Final chain (0x667F4) per cylinder: base + KL_TZ_TKORR -> rate limit K_TZ_ZWB -> + K_TZ_MCS + K_TZ_MCS_Z_ZYLi -> + min(knock adaptation, DBGR) -> + knock control -> torque cut -> max(KF_TZ_MIN) -> min(K_TZ_MAX)."
