/begin CHARACTERISTIC KF_TZ_VL
  "Vollast Zuendwinkel | EN: Full-load ignition angle | [Code V452 IGN 0x66284] Full-load ignition (n x pumg = ambient pressure rows 700/960/1030 mbar). Only in full-load state. tz = KF_TZ_GRUND(n,rf_m) + (KF_TZ_VL - KF_TZ_GRUND) x tz_tl_vl_fak, with tz_tl_vl_fak = (md_wunsch_rel - KL_ZUST_MD_TL_VL)/(100 % - KL_ZUST_MD_TL_VL): 0 at 90 % torque demand, 1.0 at 100 %. Same value for both banks. Then reduced by knock adaptation (incl. KF_KA_OFFS_VL), knock control and floored by KF_TZ_MIN."
  MAP
  0x7A0C6
  TKF_SW_SW_SW
  100.0
  FORMULA_0111
  -50.0000  
  60.0000   
  /begin AXIS_DESCR
